{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15542","headline":"晓过南宫闻太常清乐 · 张蒙","name":"晓过南宫闻太常清乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉珂经礼寺，金奏过南宫。\n雅调乘清晓，飞声向远空。\n慢随飘去雪，轻逐度来风。\n迥出重城里，傍闻九陌中。\n应将肆夏比，更与五英同。\n一听南薫曲，因知大舜功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}